# Luxel library sprite — original art, Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Classic C9 bulbs on two sagging strings, red/green/blue/gold, the second
# string offset half a bulb. Two frames trade which half of the bulbs glows
# (halo and hot core). A 32x12 tile, seamless both ways: tile it over a box.
